+  - `/mcp/agent` (**9 tools**): `search_tickets`, `read_ticket`, `create_ticket`, `update_ticket`, `begin_work`, `transition_ticket`, `complete_work`, `add_comment`, `link_objects` (schema budget `<= 2,450` tokens).
